              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 1:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanadamu, nyumba ya Israeli imekuwa taka za fedha kwangu; wote wamekuwa shaba, na bati, na chuma, na risasi, kati ya tanuu; wamekuwa taka za fedha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Kwa sababu ninyi nyote mmekuwa taka za fedha, tazama, nitawakusanya kati ya Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama vile watu wakusanyavyo fedha, na shaba, na chuma, na risasi, na bati, kati ya tanuu, ili kuvifukutia moto na kuviyeyusha; ndivyo nitakavyowakusanya ninyi katika hasira yangu, na ghadhabu yangu, nami nitawalaza huko, na kuwayeyusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, nitawakusanya, na kuwafukutia moto wa ghadhabu yangu, nanyi mtayeyushwa kati yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama fedha iyeyushwavyo kati ya tanuu, ndivyo mtakavyoyeyushwa kati yake; nanyi mtajua ya kuwa mimi, BWANA, nimemwaga ghadhabu yangu juu yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
