              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuhani wake wameihalifu sheria yangu, wametia unajisi vitu vyangu vitakatifu; hawakuweka tofauti ya vitu vitakatifu na vitu vya kutumiwa sikuzote; wala hawakuwafundisha watu kupambanua vitu vichafu na vitu vilivyo safi, nao wamefumba macho yao, wasiziangalie sabato zangu, nami nimetiwa unajisi kati yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
